=== Follow-on (same session, after DEP-163 was recorded) ===
The three decisions failed above because the decisions repository accepts an explicit identifier only when it has three digits (^DEC-\d{3}$) — the PI-493 defect. They were re-posted without an identifier so the server assigned the next ones, which landed on the identifiers the payload and its decided_in references already named. The three decided_in references had already been accepted in step 1 (the references endpoint does not check that the source exists), so they were not re-posted.
